tracked path has no spec provenance claim\n    fix: backfill an explicit claim or add an exact reviewed exclusion\n[!] warning orphan pose-mcp/internal/cli/docs_sync_test.go\n    governed tracked path has no spec provenance claim\n    fix: backfill an explicit claim or add an exact reviewed exclusion\nsurface.spec=pose-review-guard-reads-the-integrity-graph-in-place\nsurface.targets=1\nsurface.results=235\nsurface.findings=0\nsurface.provenance_digest=sha256:74222e555605eefadbfc4e23f7162a22ca5a2e84a53487533a58553f0b3e2eb1\n{\n  \"schema_version\": 1,\n  \"selected_project_id\": \"proj.pose-dist\",\n  \"selected_revision\": \"b7f9841bbd020d67d9a9f996aba1214e97417539\",\n  \"task_ref\": \"xref:proj.pose-dist/spec:pose-review-guard-reads-the-integrity-graph-in-place\",\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"project_id\": \"proj.pose-dist\",\n    \"kind\": \"spec\",\n    \"slug\": \"pose-review-guard-reads-the-integrity-graph-in-place\"\n  },\n  \"coordinator_relation\": \"same-project-authority\",\n  \"task_resolution\": {\n    \"schema_version\": 1,\n    \"identity\": {\n      \"project_id\": \"proj.pose-dist\",\n      \"kind\": \"spec\",\n      \"slug\": \"pose-review-guard-reads-the-integrity-graph-in-place\"\n    },\n    \"resolved\": true,\n    \"resolution_state\": \"resolved\",\n    \"status\": \"in-progress\",\n    \"source_revision\": \"b7f9841bbd020d67d9a9f996aba1214e97417539\",\n    \"source_digest\": \"3c1a745210c32f4e78a0fb3cd6460b9ff60f0eb98c5fdcaa7e0c96d031818512\",\n    \"dependencies\": [\n      {\n        \"project_id\": \"proj.pose-dist\",\n        \"kind\": \"spec\",\n        \"slug\": \"pose-federated-source-proof-is-computed-once-per-operation\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"authority_revision\": \"b7f9841bbd020d67d9a9f996aba1214e97417539\",\n  \"supported_contracts\": [\n    \"qualified-artifact-refs@1\",\n    \"spec-authority-transfer@1\",\n    \"federated-roadmap-acceptance@1\"\n  ],\n  \"context_revision\": \"8d0a47d40c6307dddd877bb82fffa1e8b0bf13bf67e99acede456f9afa22db7c\"\n}\n# POSE trail — review\n\nAvaliação técnica de PR/diff: escopo, contratos, segurança, validação.\n- Path:      pose-mcp → domain: backend-go (repo-map)\n- Workflow:  .pose/workflows/review.md\n- Skill:     pose-review\n- Rules:     .pose/rules/security.md, .pose/rules/documentation-style.md, .pose/rules/backend-go.md\n- Spec:      false\n- ADR:       false\n- Knowledge: consume=true, produce=handoff (quando aceitar risco residual ou condicionar merge)\n- Validation: exigir evidência de pose validate do implementador\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
